ht strain stray stream street stress stretch strict strike string strip strong struggle study stuff stump style subject submit suburb succeed such sudden sugar suggest suit summer sun sunday super supply supreme sure surface surname surprise survey sustain swab swallow swamp swap swarm swear sweat sweep sweet swell swept swim swing switch sword symbol sympathetic symptom system table tackle tag tail take tale talent talk tall tame tank tap target task taste tax taxi tea teach team tear tech temple tempo tend tennis tense tent term text thank theater theme theory therapy therefore thick thief thin thing think third thirty thorn thorough those thread threat three thrill thrive throat throne through throw thrust thumb tide tie tiger tight tile timber time tin tiny tip tire tissue title toast today toddler toe together toilet tomato tomorrow tonal tone tongue tonight too tool tooth topic tornado total touch tough tour tow towel tower town toy track trade trail train trait trance transfer trap travel tray tread treat tree tremble trend trial tribe trick trigger trim trio trip triumph trivial troop topic topple torch tornado torrent toss total tote touch tough tour trunk trust truth try tube tuition tumble tuna tunnel turn turtle twice twin twist two type typical ugly umbrella uncle under undo unemployed unicorn uniform union unique unit universal unknown unless until unusual update upgrade upper urban urge us use used useful user usual utility utter vacant vacuum valid valley value valve vanish variety various vary vast vault vegetable vehicle vendor venture verb venue verbal verdict verify vermilion verse version vessel veteran via vibrant vice victim victory view villa village vintage violet violin virtual virus visible vision visit visual vital vivid vocal voice volcano volume vote vow voyage vulnerable wage wagon waist wait wake walk wall wander want ward warm warn warp warranty warrior wash waste watch water wave way wealth weapon wear weasel weather weave web wedding weed week weigh welcome west wet whale wheat wheel when where which while whirl whisper white who whole whose why width wife wild wilderness wildlife will win wind window wine wing wink winner winter wipe wisdom wise wish with withdraw witness wool word work world worry worth wrap wrist write wrong yard year yeast yellow yet yoga yogurt young youth zebra zero zone zoom').split(' ');

    function randomBelow(max) {
      const limit = Math.floor(4294967296 / max) * max;
      const buf = new Uint32Array(1);
      let x;
      do {
        crypto.getRandomValues(buf);
        x = buf[0];
      } while (x >= limit);
      return x % max;
    }

    function buildSet() {
      let set = '';
      if ($('c-lower').checked) set += 'abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz';
      if ($('c-upper').checked) set += 'ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ';
      if ($('c-digits').checked) set += '0123456789';
      if ($('c-symbols').checked) set += '!@#$%^&*()-_=+[]{}<>?';
      if ($('c-plain').checked) set = set.replace(/[0O1lI|]/g, '');
      return set;
    }

    function generate() {
      const mode = $('mode').value;
      let pw;
      let bits;
      if (mode === 'phrase') {
        const count = 5;
        const words = [];
        for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) words.push(WORDS[randomBelow(WORDS.length)]);
        pw = words.join('-');
        bits = Math.round(count * Math.log2(WORDS.length));
      } else {
        const set = buildSet();
        if (!set) {
          $('password').textContent = 'Cochez au moins un type de caractères.';
          $('strength').textContent = '';
          return;
        }
        const len = Math.min(64, Math.max(8, parseInt($('length').value, 10) || 16));
        pw = '';
        for (let i = 0; i < len; i++) pw += set[randomBelow(set.length)];
        bits = Math.round(len * Math.log2(set.length));
      }
      $('password').textContent = pw;
      const label = bits < 50 ? 'Léger. À réserver aux comptes sans enjeu.' : bits < 75 ? 'Correct. Suffisant pour la plupart des comptes.' : bits < 100 ? 'Fort. Largement hors de portée des attaques par devinette.' : 'Très fort. Au-delà de toute attaque par devinette existante.';
      $('strength').textContent = 'Environ ' + bits + ' bits d’entropie. ' + label;
      $('copied').textContent = '';
    }

    $('gen').addEventListener('click', generate);
    for (const id of ['length', 'c-lower', 'c-upper', 'c-digits', 'c-symbols', 'c-plain', 'mode']) {
      $(id).addEventListener('change', generate);
    }
    $('copy').addEventListener('click', async () => {
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText($('password').textContent);
        $('copied').textContent = 'Copié.';
      } catch {
        $('copied').textContent = 'La copie n’a pas fonctionné ici, sélectionnez le texte et copiez-le à la main.';
      }
    });
    generate();
  </script>
</Base>
